 number stone field copper lantern mirror feather canvas garden copper pocket helmet timber helmet orbit story candle harbor falcon hollow candle valley quiet planet forest maple shadow river orbit saddle square violet cotton helmet mirror candle cotton forest market candle narrow winter yellow candle meadow pocket marble candle narrow corner rocket lantern falcon window meadow orange simple ladder thunder circle mirror music basket narrow lantern feather number anchor square silver circle paper anchor violet steady marble quiet lantern rocket yellow anchor narrow thunder canvas orange orbit number feather meadow cotton engine steady number table thunder rapid rapid stone anchor market forest orbit field square basket corner planet copper table silver orbit cabin anchor rocket golden orange music planet falcon harbor maple anchor helmet silver winter circle music ribbon garden orbit valley meadow thunder garden market planet meadow gentle signal orange basket yellow island rapid anchor market meadow feather cabin lantern planet silver planet ladder valley ribbon pocket copper canvas music basket garden valley narrow cotton\\n\\nWrite a story of about 700 words that uses as many of the words above as you can.\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":8192,\"thinkingConfig\":{\"thinkingLevel\":\"low\"}}}"
